  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/136d9093ea317ffec9.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"אגוזים וּמַזְמֵּרׇת  ענבים\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/136d9093ea317ffec9.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div></span></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מְאַתְּרִים אֲתָרִים</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גלו את המקומות והאתרים (המוזכרים בפרשה) - עפ\"י משפטי החידה.<br />לדוגמא:<br />משפט החידה הבא \"כְּשֵׁם סֵפֶר הַדְּרָשׁוֹת - בְּעִנְיַן מַעֲבָר הָעוֹלָמוֹת\" רומז על האתר מַעֲבָר יַבֹּק.<br />בונוס:<br />תמונת הפוסט רומזת על הפתרון לחידות 5-6.</span><h4 style=\"text-align: right;\"><p></p></h4><p></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִכָּאן יָצָא בִּצְלִיעָה - אֲבִי הָאֻמָּה.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעִיר בָּהּ נִקְבַּר - הַשֵּׁבֶט הַאַחַד עָשָׂר.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְגוּרֵי הַפַּת - בְּדֶרֶךְ אֶפְרָת.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל שֵׁם הָאָב וְהַיְּלָדִים - שֶׁהָיוּ כֻּלָּם עֲנָקִים.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְמָקוֹם זֶה שְׁנֵי שֵׁמוֹת - אֶחָד מֵהֶם מֻזְכָּר בְּמַקְּלוֹת הַמְּפֻצָּלוֹת.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּעִיר זוֹ הִתְחוֹלְלוּ קְרָבוֹת עַזִּים - בֵּין הָאָמֵרִיקָאִים וּבֵין הַבַּבְלִים.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עִיר מְעָרַת הַקְּבוּרָה - הַנִּקְרֵאת גַּם קִרְיַת אַרְבַּע.</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶחָד מֵאַלּוּפֵי הַחֹרִי - כְּאַרְצוֹ שֶׁל הַמְּיֻסָּר הַתָּנָכִ\"י.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶחָד מֵאַלּוּפֵי שֵׂעִיר - שְׁכוּנָה בְּהוֹד הַשָּׁרוֹן הָעִיר.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל שֵׁם צֶבַע הַשָּׂעִיר - שֶׁמָּכַר חֶלְקוֹ לַצָּעִיר.</span></span></li></ol><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h2><div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מילת תנאי<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שאינו מסוגל לְדַבֵּר (כתיב חסר)<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מכניס 'בתוך' - בלי מקום פנוי<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 נוטל נכסים מֵהַפְּרָט למדינה\n<span>🔲🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 שליחים (מהפרשה)\n</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 מושלים שהוכתרו</span>\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 נגמרים\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 יחידת אורך - בעיקר למרחק בים\n</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 עֵשָׂו שאל: \"-- לך כל המחנה\" </span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">(מהפרשה)</span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">מאתרים אתרים</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3></div><div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">פנואל</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">שכם</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">בית לחם</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">קרית ארבע</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">לוז</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">בצרה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">חברון</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">עוץ</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">מגדיאל</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">אדום</span></span></li></ol></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אם, אלם, ממלא, מָלְאִים, מלאכים, מלכים, כלים, מיל, מי</span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div><br />"
